{
  "_comment": "Maps product names seen in nmap -sV, httpx tech-detect (Wappalyzer), HTTP headers and Shodan CPEs to NVD CPE vendor:product pairs. 'match' entries are case-insensitive regexes applied to the normalised product name. Add entries to extend CVE coverage.",
